    <code code="42348-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Advance directives"/>
    <title>Advance Care Planning</title>
    <text><paragraph>Voluntary advance care planning discussion of about 16 minutes, with his consent. He named a health care agent, recorded in the confidential part of the chart and not named here. He said that if he were ever too ill to decide, he would want his agent and his clinicians to know what matters to him, including his faith, and to make decisions with that in mind. He chose not to record specific treatment preferences today. To be revisited yearly or if his health changes. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
